9"]},"ordering_evidence":"wuwen-q-5b274028735263e1e039","order":4050}],"persons":[{"id":"mingdi-p0001","name":"曹蕤","evidence":["mingdi-q-o001","wuwen-q-438dddb92032bf38ea46","wuwen-q-5b274028735263e1e039","wuwen-q-801bfd51dbc004b372f7","wuwen-q-7ce1991c2b52380d3b11"],"facts":[{"id":"wuwen-f-31227fd9570ed4699bbe","text":"父为曹丕；本传记母为潘淑媛。","evidence":["wuwen-q-7ce1991c2b52380d3b11"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"mingdi-m-o001-mingdi-p0001","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["mingdi-q-o001"]},{"id":"mingdi-m-o031-mingdi-p0001","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["mingdi-q-o031"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"mingdi-e-o001g-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-fe69417d79b76e276a24","layer":"original","quote":"明皇帝讳叡，字元仲。文帝太子也。生而太祖爱之，常令在左右。﹝一﹞年十五，封武德侯。黄初二年为齐公。三年为平原王〖1〗。以其母诛，故未建为嗣。﹝二﹞七年夏五月〖2〗，帝病笃，乃立为皇太子。丁巳〖3〗，即皇帝位。大赦；尊皇太后曰太皇太后〖4〗，皇后曰皇太后〖5〗；诸臣封爵各有差。﹝三﹞〔六月〕，癸未〖6〗，追谥母甄夫人曰文昭皇后〖7〗。壬辰〖8〗，立皇弟蕤为阳平王〖9〗。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":185},{"id":"mingdi-e-o031b-q","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-dd732834eeba0c3333ad","layer":"original","quote":"夏五月，壬申〖5〗，诏祀故大将军夏侯惇、大司马曹仁、车骑将军程昱于太祖庙庭。﹝一﹞戊寅〖6〗，北海王蕤薨。闰月，庚寅朔，日有食之。丁酉〖7〗，改封宗室女非诸王女，皆为邑主。诏诸郡国：“山川不在祠典者，勿祠。”六月，洛阳宫鞠室灾〖8〗。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":211,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":117},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-7a11c761ca65aeb3d195","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗二年：青龙二年（公元 234）。己未：旧历初四日。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":252,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-6c0753fe684a18a3a281","start":0,"end":28},{"id":"mingdi-q-b-b7b4e1eced04c86a11c0","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-b7b4e1eced04c86a11c0","layer":"modern","quote":"〖2〗七年：黄初七年（公元226）。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":4,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-7290e2008f81d6cad349","start":0,"end":18},{"id":"mingdi-q-o001","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-fe69417d79b76e276a24","layer":"original","quote":"明皇帝讳叡，字元仲。文帝太子也。生而太祖爱之，常令在左右。﹝一﹞年十五，封武德侯。黄初二年为齐公。三年为平原王〖1〗。以其母诛，故未建为嗣。﹝二﹞七年夏五月〖2〗，帝病笃，乃立为皇太子。丁巳〖3〗，即皇帝位。大赦；尊皇太后曰太皇太后〖4〗，皇后曰皇太后〖5〗；诸臣封爵各有差。﹝三﹞〔六月〕，癸未〖6〗，追谥母甄夫人曰文昭皇后〖7〗。壬辰〖8〗，立皇弟蕤为阳平王〖9〗。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":1,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":185},{"id":"mingdi-q-o030","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-cb99fef1996d806deb1c","layer":"original","quote":"青龙元年春正月，甲申〖1〗，青龙现郏之摩陂井中〖2〗。二月，丁酉〖3〗，幸摩陂观龙。于是改年，改摩陂为龙陂。赐男子爵，人二级；鳏寡孤独。无出今年租赋。三月，甲子〖4〗，诏公卿举贤良、笃行之士。各一人。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":210,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":100},{"id":"mingdi-q-o031","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-dd732834eeba0c3333ad","layer":"original","quote":"夏五月，壬申〖5〗，诏祀故大将军夏侯惇、大司马曹仁、车骑将军程昱于太祖庙庭。﹝一﹞戊寅〖6〗，北海王蕤薨。闰月，庚寅朔，日有食之。丁酉〖7〗，改封宗室女非诸王女，皆为邑主。诏诸郡国：“山川不在祠典者，勿祠。”六月，洛阳宫鞠室灾〖8〗。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":211,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":117},{"id":"mingdi-q-o037","section":"chapter-003","block":"b-ff97c2d326d0fc08a9de","layer":"original","quote":"二年春二月，（乙）〔己〕未〖1〗，太白犯荧惑。癸酉〖2〗，诏曰：“‘鞭作官刑〖3〗’，所以纠慢怠也〖4〗；而顷多以无辜死。其减鞭杖之制〖5〗，著于令。”三月，庚寅〖6〗，山阳公薨；帝素服发哀〖7〗，遣使持节，典护丧事。己酉〖8〗，大赦。","section_title":"明帝纪第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0011.xhtml","index":249,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":118},{"id":"wuwen-q-438dddb92032bf38ea46","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-2dc64688aca4b0a736fc","layer":"original","quote":"北海悼王蕤，黄初七年明帝即位，立为阳平县王。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":230,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":22},{"id":"wuwen-q-5b274028735263e1e039","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-2dc64688aca4b0a736fc","layer":"original","quote":"太和六年，改封北海。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":230,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":22,"end":32},{"id":"wuwen-q-7ce1991c2b52380d3b11","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-08bc87032dff67a1e7b2","layer":"original","quote":"文皇帝九男：甄氏皇后生明帝；李贵人生赞哀王协；潘淑媛生北海悼王蕤；朱淑媛生东武阳怀王鉴；仇昭仪生东海定王霖；徐姬生元城哀王礼；苏姬生邯郸怀王邕；张姬生清河悼王贡；宋姬生广平哀王俨。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":228,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":90},{"id":"wuwen-q-801bfd51dbc004b372f7","section":"chapter-020","block":"b-2dc64688aca4b0a736fc","layer":"original","quote":"青龙元年，薨。","section_title":"武文世王公传第二十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0045.xhtml","index":230,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":32,"end":39}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
